  "details": "I would like to see non vr users get the ability to just simply press a key on there keyboard to activate animations, be able to move with them and have them out for as long as they like just like what you can do with vr controllers.\n\nfor those who dont know what my point is, this is how vr players are able to get items in the game and be able to move around with them in there hands and it's only for vr users and i want it to also be for non vr users.\n\nIt's just button mapping for the keyboard like for the vr controller, it would let non vr users the ability to have more creative ability for there avatars and not have to worry about having to buy vr.\n\nI hope there's a decent amount of you people who agree with me here and want this to be implemented in the game.",
